<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―At 11 a.m., with my neck held in place so it wouldn't hurt, I received endoscopic treatment for my stomach.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally it would have been better to have the treatment once my neck was in better shape, but if it were left a few more days, apparently I'd need open surgery.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The endoscopic treatment for my stomach was also completed without trouble.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Even at a time this serious, I'm bored.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's a lot I should be thinking about, but there's nothing I can do about any of it right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've left everything to <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and am having her look for a way to cure <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why did my blood put <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> in a state like that?<PG>
If the same ephedrine-like substance is inside both of us, it wouldn't be strange for me to end up in a state like <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only ways I'm different from other people are that I hate cherry blossoms, and my intuition at this time of year.<PG>
If, as <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> said, this constitution has something to do with it, it might be worth digging into it from that angle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do is think about the things only I know, and try listing anything that might give even a small hint.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I pick up the notepad and pen set out on the bedside table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My arms and legs move a lot better now, so I'll try writing down anything that might be a hint, which doubles as rehab.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
First, I think about what caused me to end up with this constitution.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After the incident 2 years ago, I heard the rough background of the incident from <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\風船.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If, as <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> says, contact with blood is the cause of <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> frenzy, then my being drenched in <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's dad's</STYLE> blood may have something to do with it too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was there something like ephedrine inside <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's dad's</STYLE> body too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll copy <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and think it through, assuming that was the case.<PG>
If <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's dad</STYLE> had been alive, would I, like <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, have been <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="さいな">tormented</STYLE> by fierce murderous intent?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm... it's early to say so, but it's hard to think any further along this line...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It might be pointless, but I'll jot down what I just thought.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Okay, the next angle―I'll think back over what happened last night.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\手を握る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Last night, in <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> hospital room―
{PAUSE ""}
That's right, I'd forgotten, but before I was strangled, I sensed danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason must be that I foresaw that frenzy of <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花首絞め2.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The instant I foresaw it, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>... my neck...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? Something's weird...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The instant I foresaw it, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> strangled me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally I can foresee things 10 seconds ahead, even at the very shortest.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> strangling me the instant I foresaw it is weird.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the first place, landing in danger the very instant you foresee it isn't even foresight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, wait, wait. I wasn't strangled the instant I foresaw it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\手を握る反転.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The instant I foresaw danger, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> squeezed my hand hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That wasn't the strength of a person who'd been asleep for 2 whole years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could the frenzy brought on by reflex have started at that point?<PG>
It really is weird!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Foreseeing <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> frenzy as danger is natural enough, but <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> starting her frenzy right after that, without a moment's gap, is clearly strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> had caught hold of me at that point, so it was a situation where the danger was hard to avoid.<PG>
Could it be the other way around?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Rather than me foreseeing danger, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> reacted to my foresight...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> feel murderous intent toward me for foreseeing danger?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I might be overthinking it, but I'll write this down too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, there's a knock on the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes, come in."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Boss!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, good. You look better than I expected."
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The manager seems to have come to visit me with a bouquet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I'd had a shift yesterday, and I'd skipped it without telling anyone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\お見舞い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Boss, um... I'm sorry, I left my shift empty..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"When something like this happens, it can't be helped. 
{PAUSE ""}
Hm...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The manager's eyes go to my notes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the words written there, 'ephedrine' and 'drenched in blood' and 'strangled,' the manager frowns a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, um, this is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Trying to write a novel or something?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">yes, something like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ephedrine, huh. 
{PAUSE ""}
My wife often takes a Chinese herbal remedy with mao in it when she catches a cold."<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mao?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You write it 'hemp' and 'yellow'―it's a plant called <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="まおう">mao</STYLE>, ephedra. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ever heard of <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="かっこんとう">kakkonto</STYLE>? Apparently it's the ephedrine from the mao in it that does the trick."<PG>
So ephedrine was something surprisingly familiar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But given there's an abnormality like mine and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE>, it must be something <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="・・・">like</STYLE> ephedrine after all.<PG>
―After that, I spent the time chatting about this and that with the manager.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He told me he'd let the regulars know my return to work was still undecided.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, I never got to see Cho-san use the sexual-harassment beer coupon I gave him the day before yesterday...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd even thought up some banter for when he used it, so it's a little disappointing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Even after the manager has gone, there's no word from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she still running around all over the place?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, removing an unknown drug from a body is no ordinary task.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I have to remember more of the things only I know, and think.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anything will do, however <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ささい">trivial</STYLE>.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
If ephedrine is that familiar, there ought to be people besides me and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> who end up with this kind of constitution.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet it's a case even the doctors don't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm going to think from here, I need to track down someone besides me and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> who had a strange constitution.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there anyone...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">My dad</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
there was nothing particularly strange about him, and the same goes for <STYLE ID="12">my mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What about <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That sharp head, that body as small as a child's, and that gigantic stomach―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, this probably has nothing to do with it...<PG>
Other than that...
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬鉈.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There's <STYLE ID="13">Haruka's mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">She</STYLE> was the prime suspect, and right after the incident 2 years ago, she burned herself to death.<PG>
Following the accepted theory, let's say <STYLE ID="13">Haruka's mom</STYLE> was the shinigami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was there anything strange about <STYLE ID="13">Haruka's mom</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Haruka's mom</STYLE>, as I knew her, dressed younger than her age, was cheerful, and always full of energy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A person like that, of all people, swinging a nata around, chasing us wherever we went...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花武器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Stop it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! It's me! It's Haruka! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'm begging you, don't lay a hand on </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神鉈振り上げ上半身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Daaamn! Raaaah!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\つばぜり合い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "0" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, stop it...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\引きずる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n-300\r\n300\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n-300\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Damn...! What is it with this monstrous strength...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That time, <STYLE ID="13">Haruka's mom</STYLE> was pushing back <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> two-handed attack with one hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All of <STYLE ID="2">Haruka's</STYLE> weight, dragging it back bit by bit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter how you look at it, wasn't that strength way too monstrous...?<PG>
Even if her chasing us everywhere and finding us right away was some kind of trick, there's no faking that strength.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It goes beyond the <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="はんちゅう">bounds</STYLE> of a woman's strength.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's about the only strange thing, though...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They said ephedrine is used to make stimulants, so it's possible <STYLE ID="13">Haruka's mom</STYLE> was doping with that kind of drug too...<PG>
If so, a drug would have been detected in the body of <STYLE ID="13">Haruka's mom</STYLE> too, the same as with us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I haven't heard anything like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could she have burned herself to death to destroy that?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
