<STYLE ID="6">"Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"After sleeping all this time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> keeps moving that violently, even if it's by reflex. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So it seems it's putting a heavy strain on her weakened heart and lungs..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
