{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It seems they're already using them, but since the movement is by reflex, they don't seem to be having much effect..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Then put her under anesthesia and keep her asleep, or something...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Anesthesia would suppress that frenzy through loss of reflexes, apparently. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But her brain would stay asleep the whole time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Using anesthesia for a long period means the chance of her waking up gets even lower, they said... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If it's only to keep her alive, that option is possible, apparently, but..."</STYLE><PG>
